;CRYSTALS WERE GROWN AT 19C BY VAPOUR DIFFUSION IN HANGING DROPS FROM 1.0M AMMONIUM SULFATE IN WATER. PROTEIN STOCK WAS
BACE MUT46B BATCH XII 8.5MG/ML IN 10MM TRIS-HCL PH 7.4, 25MM NACL, WITH A 5-FOLD EXCESS OF BMC025 ADDED FROM A 50MM
STOCK SOLUTION IN 90% DMSO-D6 (1.8% DMSO IN DROP). A SOLUTION CONTAINING 1.2M AMMONIUM SULFATE, 25% GLYCEROL, 1MM BMC025
AND 1.8% DMSO WAS USED AS CRYO-PROTECTANT.
